<title>USA: FSA qualifies Flordia's capital outlay bonds.</title>
<headline>FSA qualifies Flordia's capital outlay bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance on Wednesday said that it qualified for insurance Florida's $189.84 million captial outlay bonds issue, which will be sold competitively on Wednesday.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
